# JS/Tauri consoles (console/kovanica, console/enterprise, console/shared):
# installed dependencies and Vite build output are never committed. Keep this
# unanchored so a newly added console inherits the rules without an edit here.
# `node_modules` has no trailing slash because console/shared/node_modules is a
# symlink, and the slash form would not match it.
node_modules
dist/

